{"schema_version":1,"status":"partial","epoch":"zhcn-67f8551f7780","task_id":"batch-01234-s00","batch":1234,"shard":0,"source_commit":"67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835","source_queue_git_commit":"ba3815ed06a2a9bb3fddb38a6e1ea7ca64506da2","shard_start":0,"shard_end_exclusive":20,"translated_count":10,"entries":[{"entry_index":0,"uid":"zhcn:3bf8d2c989a879d376340cef","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"对手是谁都可以──\r\n试着让我认真起来吧……！","source_fingerprint":"fc7e43b0d6a91dd11536f25c0bc8c1e47d9c9f13335923c51dbcbd1785622ced","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1016","20024"],"target_text":"Đối thủ là ai cũng được──\r\nThử khiến ta phải nghiêm túc xem nào……!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":1,"uid":"zhcn:bdc642805c7571d279fd692c","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"热血沸腾……\r\n对决即将要开始了……！","source_fingerprint":"1a582d7375fb7028f4d175b1bd054014a8f6e88977d26e54a56f8030359a1818","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1016","20025"],"target_text":"Máu nóng đang sôi lên……\r\nTrận quyết đấu sắp bắt đầu rồi……!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":2,"uid":"zhcn:2bcec58d715498585d342fda","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"……想被我狩猎的家伙在哪？\r\n我来成全你们。","source_fingerprint":"e720adeedf7d40114910b7058c46ed12389f59f6e6c0add835de1b3b88420638","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1016","20026"],"target_text":"……Kẻ nào muốn bị ta săn đâu rồi?\r\nTa sẽ chiều các ngươi.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":3,"uid":"zhcn:334440f2ffc9dd1f293e9c09","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"很快就能定出胜负了吧。\r\n──瞬间高下立判。","source_fingerprint":"05e34a28224158cd77a33b272dcb4cb571b55c73007ad04940112bc7fde01591","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1016","20027"],"target_text":"Chắc sẽ phân thắng bại nhanh thôi.\r\n──Chỉ một thoáng là biết ai hơn ai.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":4,"uid":"zhcn:bd0f0d7f80be0575ef832168","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"我只要用实力压倒所有人就行了。","source_fingerprint":"41463c1c1bd9f723e7470ff0bd8857525fa438955e06adf5abed1199c2cc8473","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1016","20028"],"target_text":"Ta chỉ cần dùng thực lực áp đảo tất cả là được.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":5,"uid":"zhcn:43ae05980764f451457e675d","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"……拿下胜利。仅此而已。","source_fingerprint":"8c5bc8d32e175800ddf1124454bf01bd0446828a2969e332a20b2cbd75803c74","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1016","20029"],"target_text":"……Giành chiến thắng. Chỉ vậy thôi.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":6,"uid":"zhcn:28e34b677ee8a557f5404383","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"发挥一直以来锻炼的成果吧。","source_fingerprint":"11da74ede572e904da6184cbe6a0f574e97d6cf9e269f9c3d38cf2bb8de2f4ff","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1016","20030"],"target_text":"Phát huy thành quả rèn luyện bấy lâu thôi.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":7,"uid":"zhcn:3cf8361e09e58b8e1cdf06c8","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"我已经等不及……\r\n要听到开场小号的声音了。","source_fingerprint":"de615668ac7b5c5e37efc8d33ddfb469bf62941a879a9570fea78a28d0a77796","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1016","20031"],"target_text":"Ta không chờ nổi nữa……\r\nMuốn nghe tiếng kèn hiệu khai cuộc lắm rồi.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":8,"uid":"zhcn:2ba0c7b4d06c3bd7bf8a5952","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"就这种程度……没问题的。\r\n不用特别担心。","source_fingerprint":"3c78a3f25423e0e0a69dc116df14ed7810143f47a07e8091bf7b594db6805ccf","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1016","20032"],"target_text":"Chỉ mức này thôi…… không sao.\r\nKhông cần lo lắng quá.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":9,"uid":"zhcn:4d3248d96af19b46cf7abb78","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"虽然会多少影响到我的表现……\r\n……但也只需要去克服而已。","source_fingerprint":"ef549219ce0bf0836368b8e398e6103041620fdcc2ba4f71cb55f22ebcacf8e0","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1016","20033"],"target_text":"Dù sẽ ảnh hưởng ít nhiều đến màn thể hiện của ta……\r\n……thì cũng chỉ cần vượt qua thôi.","reviewed":true}]}